1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
A sprig of mint repaired the air.

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:09,780
Joseph Priestley burned a candle in a sealed jar until the flame died, and no new flame would light.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,020
He slid in a sprig of mint and waited.

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:18,320
Ten days later, a candle burned bright in that same air.

5
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:23,080
Somehow, the little green plant had made the air good again.
